[14:17.29]Recording One
[14:19.15]Good morning, everyone. 
[14:20.69]I am Mary White, the secretary of the Exciting Sports Club. 
[14:25.41]Welcome to attend the match-arrangement meeting. 
[14:28.71]Now I'd like to give you a short presentation on our arrangement of this season.
[14:33.86]During this season, we still have competitions like football, volleyball, basketball, etc. 
[14:41.20]But today, we will focus on two of them¡ªone is tennis and the other is soccer. 
[14:47.26]There will be six teams taking part in the tennis competition, while the number of soccer teams is only four, and we hope all the players are no more than 20 years old. 
[14:58.14]Now, there are some changes. 
[15:00.39]The first one is the venue. 
[15:02.43]We will arrange all our matches for both the tennis and the soccer competitions in Magic Park instead of Darry Park, which was used last year. 
[15:12.09]Tennis matches will be arranged on Court 2 and on Court 4 will be soccer matches.
[15:18.11]On our match schedule all tennis matches will be played on Sunday afternoons as usual. 
[15:24.30]All matches will begin at 2 pm. 
[15:27.45]Soccer matches in this season will still be played at 7 o'clock on Saturday evenings. 
[15:33.76]The joining fee is the same, 30 pounds, including new sports gear. 
[15:39.17]We still offer a week of training sessions before formal matches for our new players. 
[15:44.87]The fee is only 12 pounds.
[15:47.08]In addition, we offer some activities to thank all the players. 
[15:51.35]Please look at your brochure. 
[15:53.40]There are some activities and their time arrangements. 
[15:56.89]As the beginning, we are to start the season with a barbecue dinner next Saturday in Magic Park. 
[16:03.57]I do really hope all players will go there to enjoy the dinner. 
[16:07.92]You may invite your relatives and friends, while they have to pay a little fee of just 5 pounds.
[16:14.50]And then, after the final match of this season, we will vote this season's MVP (the most valuable player). 
[16:22.03]The two top players from the tennis team and the soccer team will gain an honor and a prize from our sports center. 
[16:29.41]At the end, we hope all the players can send a confirmation letter to us to ensure our match arrangement. 
[16:36.04]So please write to us before the deadline. Thank you!
